silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_26_circuit_imprint_tensor_sections_02_eight_corners_atlas_concrete_anchor_8#atlasindex_8corners silm:hasLongDescription "The AtlasIndex_8corners is the index of all 8 corners with cross-references to which papers in the 42-entry encyclopedia activate which corners. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'AtlasIndex_8corners', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
